      "color": "purple",
      "source": "    async def _safe_send_json(payload: dict[str, Any]) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"向当前 WebSocket 发送 JSON；连接已关闭时只记录状态，不再抛出网关异常。\n\n        AI 请求在后台任务中运行，前端断开连接或测试脚本终止时，后台任务可能仍处于\n        LLM 调用、文件生成或取消清理阶段。此时继续直接 ``websocket.send_json`` 会触发\n        Starlette 的 ``Unexpected ASGI message``。网关层只负责传输，不能让这种连接生命周期\n        竞争污染业务错误日志。\n        \"\"\"\n        nonlocal connection_closed\n        if connection_closed:\n            return False\n        try:\n            await websocket.send_json(payload)\n            return True\n        except (RuntimeError, WebSocketDisconnect):\n            connection_closed = True\n            logger.info(\"ws send skipped after disconnect session=%s\", session_id)\n            return False",
