      "note": "第 410 行之后尚未进入，不能把 AgentRequest 或 Engine 视为已执行。",
      "color": "orange",
      "source": "    async def _run_chat_agent_request(\n        self,\n        *,\n        session_id: str,\n        user_id: str,\n        prompt: str,\n        ui_context: dict[str, Any] | None,\n        request_id: str,\n    ) -> AgentResponse:\n        \"\"\"装配 chat 请求并进入共享执行核心。\"\"\"\n        session_memory = self.session_memory_builder.build(\n            self.session_memory_store.list_recent(\n                user_id=user_id,\n                session_id=session_id,\n            ),\n            events=self.session_memory_store.list_recent_events(\n                user_id=user_id,\n                session_id=session_id,\n            ),\n        )\n        self._append_memory_event(\n            user_id=user_id,\n            session_id=session_id,\n            event=self._memory_event_factory.build_user_message_event(\n                user_id=user_id,\n                session_id=session_id,\n                request_id=request_id,\n                occurred_at=now_utc_iso(),\n                prompt=prompt,\n            ),\n        )\n        # MemoryStore 只负责按会话读取原始记录，SessionMemoryBuilder 负责压缩为短期记忆；\n        # ContextPipeline 只接收强类型 SessionMemory，再把白名单摘要投影给后续链路。\n        context_pack = self._context_pipeline.build(\n            request_id=request_id,\n            session_id=session_id,\n            user_id=user_id,\n            user_message=prompt,\n            raw_ui_context=ui_context or {},\n            session_memory=session_memory,\n        )",
      "sourceHash": "744e0fd1236ba9da51062e582297808611b4918ab9782fbf34e50129b6b38832",
